strating feature about this laptop is the keyboard. Due to the number pad, they have shifted the letters left, so if youve learned to touch type, you need to shift your hands.left of the neutral position in order to hit the right keys.
Otherwise a snappy laptop, great for school and gaming use for my kid.</div><span aria-live="polite" class="bv-rnr__bm6gry-0 cViGBA"></span><button type="button" class="bv-rnr__sc-16j1lpy-5 bv-rnr__ibbdst-2 dOWFMv dClOml">Traducir con Google</button><div class="bv-rnr__sc-16dr7i1-13 flweSz"><div class="bv-rnr__sc-1i2zvgg-2 jReCpT"><div class="bv-rnr__sc-1i2zvgg-0 ceEEwL"><span class="bv-rnr__sc-1y8lyw5-0 gIgVUl badge-label"><span aria-hidden="true" class="bv-rnr__sc-1y8lyw5-1 duBGiu"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" version="1" viewBox="0 0 243 230" aria-hidden="true" class="bv-rnr__qdad0u-0 gwUSq"><path d="M1033 2254c-343-57-646-279-805-589-114-224-152-453-113-693 77-475 452-850 927-927 607-98 1184 318 1283 927 77 476-163 950-590 1170-223 114-463 152-702 112zm-170-625c12-6 97-86 189-177l168-167 172 172c189 187 208 199 267 167 39-21 57-60 46-102-4-16-73-94-178-199l-171-173 171-172c105-106 174-184 178-200 11-42-7-81-46-102-59-32-78-20-266 167l-173 171-172-171C937 733 865 669 846 664c-63-15-127 50-111 113 4 18 71 93 178 201l171 172-171 173c-110 110-174 182-179 201-18 74 62 139 129 105z" transform="matrix(.1 0 0 -.1 0 230)"></path></svg></span><span class="bv-rnr__sc-1y8lyw5-2 vNitB"></span></span></div><p class="bv-rnr__sc-1i2zvgg-1 iszExj">No, No recomiendo este producto.</p></div></div><div class="bv-rnr__sc-1grr47e-0 hjOpfY"><div class="bv-rnr__sc-1grr47e-1 gHTJFH"><img src="https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg/82175106-5b43-40bd-9ffd-53c5cd34a268" alt="" width="50" height="50"></div><div class="bv-rnr__sc-1grr47e-2 kdXGEG"><p class="bv-rnr__sc-1grr47e-3 hCiaBm">Publicado originalmente en el sitio web HP.com Australia para Victus 15.6 inch Gaming Laptop 15-fb3088AX, Silver</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="bv-rnr__sc-16dr7i1-11 bDrXSA"></div></div></div></div></section><section id="bv-review-1210983300" aria-label="6 de 8 reseñas, valoraciones 5 de 5."><div class="bv-rnr__sc-16dr7i1-