lass="bv-rnr__sc-1aslhq8-0 dLXqSJ"></span><span class="bv-rnr__sc-1y8lyw5-2 vNitB">Comprador verificado</span></span></button></li></ul></div><div class="bv-rnr__g3jej5-0 JgZrm"><meta itemprop="dateCreated" content="2025-12-29T17:34:44.000+00:00"><meta itemprop="datePublished" content="2025-12-30T14:22:40.000+00:00"><span class="bv-rnr__g3jej5-1 jolJQc">hace 4 meses</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="bv-rnr__sc-16dr7i1-14 fKdXxQ"><div data-bv-v="contentSummary" class="bv-rnr__sc-16dr7i1-7 hFQwhN"><div tabindex="-1" id="bv-review-text-374612189" itemprop="reviewBody" class="bv-rnr__sc-16dr7i1-3 fLXmig">Me gusta mucho la laptop, creo que podria mejorar con respecto al recalentamiento, pero en general funciona bien, aunque a veces se puede sobresaturar por los programas de arquitectura.</div><div class="bv-rnr__sc-16dr7i1-13 flweSz"><div class="bv-rnr__sc-1i2zvgg-2 jReCpT"><div class="bv-rnr__sc-1i2zvgg-0 ceEEwL"><span class="bv-rnr__sc-1y8lyw5-0 gIgVUl badge-label"><span aria-hidden="true" class="bv-rnr__sc-1y8lyw5-1 duBGiu"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 30 30" aria-hidden="true" class="bv-rnr__nifwaj-0 eGuNKi"><g fill="none" fill-rule="evenodd" stroke="none" stroke-width="1"><g transform="translate(-39 -539)"><g transform="translate(39 539)"><path d="M0 0H30V30H0z"></path><g transform="translate(1 1)"><circle cx="14" cy="14" r="14" fill="#000"></circle><path fill="#FFF" stroke="#FFF" stroke-width="0.5" d="M11.0909091 17.4925373L7.27272727 13.7313433 6 14.9850746 11.0909091 20 22 9.25373134 20.7272727 8z"></path></g></g></g></g></svg></span><span class="bv-rnr__sc-1y8lyw5-2 vNitB"></span></span></div><p class="bv-rnr__sc-1i2zvgg-1 iszExj">Sí, Recomiendo este producto.</p></div></div><div class="bv-rnr__sc-1grr47e-0 hjOpfY"><div class="bv-rnr__sc-1grr47e-1 gHTJFH"><img src="https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg/30b3a8ed-1da7-4dae-ba6e-303e70ad9b1e" alt="" width="50" height="50"></div><div class="bv-rnr__sc-1grr47e-2 kdXGEG"><p class="bv-rnr__sc-1grr47e-3 hCiaBm">Publicado originalmente en el sitio web HP.com Peru para Laptop HP Gaming VICTUS Victus Gaming 15-fb3021la, AMD Ryzen 7, 16 GB GPU NVIDIA® GeForce RTX™ 4050, 512 GB SSD, 15.6, FHD Windows 11 Home</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="bv-rnr__sc-16dr7i1-11 bDrXSA"><div class="bv-rnr__sc-16dr7i1-7 bv-rnr__sc-12ow35w-0 hFQwhN bgUXxc"><div class="bv-rnr__sc-16dr7i1-9 bv-rnr__sc-12ow35w-1 hgOIhC kHWzzm"><div class="bv-rnr__tbt1zd-1 ibLuYb"><svg width="22" height="20" viewBox="0 0 22 20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><defs><filter id="bv-rnr_374612189_0"><fecolormatrix in="SourceGraphic" values="0 0 0 0 0.290196 0 0 0 0 0.290196 0 0 0 0 0.290196 0 0 0 1.000000 0"></fecolormatrix></filter></defs><g transform="translate(-17 -8)" filter="&quot;url(https://www.hp.com/co-es/shop/portatil-hp-gaming-victus-15-fb3008la-amd-ryzen-5-16-gb-ram-nvidia-geforce-rtx-4050-1-tb-ssd-15-6-fhd-144-hz-windows-11-home-ba1u8la.html)&quot;" fill="#000" fill-rule="evenodd"><path d="M36.609 8H24.766a2.362 2.362 0 00-2.368 2.358v7.143a2.362 2.362 0 002.368 2.358h8.13l2.688 2.676c.16.159.387.272.638.272.227 0 .432-.09.614-.25.183-.158.274-.407.274-.657v-2.109c1.07-.226 1.89-1.179 1.89-2.313v-7.097A2.386 2.386 0 0036.609 8zm-2.528 5.918l-.957.953-2.186 2.177-1.07-1.066 1.32-1.315h-3.894V13.17h3.894l-.364-.363-.957-.952 1.07-1.066.957.952 1.116 1.112.797.793.274.272zM17 22.694v-7.166a2.362 2.362 0 012.369-2.358h1.434v1.655H19.37a.708.708 0 00-.706.703v7.143c0 .386.318.726.728.726h1.185v1.86l1.867-1.86h8.814a.732.732 0 00.729-.726v-1.224h.273l1.366 1.36c-.068 1.247-1.116 2.222-2.368 2.222h-8.153l-2.688 2.699a.815.815 0 01-.615.272.887.887 0 01-.888-.884v-2.11C17.82 24.78 17 23.829 17 22.695z" fill-rule="nonzero" class="bv-rnr__quqo74-0 evykxV"></path></g></svg></div><div class="bv-rnr__tbt1zd-0 hSRRmN"><div class="bv-rnr__tbt1zd-1 eRTmFz"><div class="bv-rnr__sc-12ow35w-5 kEvInz">Respuesta de HP.com Peru:</div></div><div class="bv-rnr__tbt1zd-1 jurqdE"><div class="bv-rnr__g3jej5-0 JgZrm"><span class="bv-rnr__g3jej5-1 jolJQc">hace 4 meses</span></div></div></div></div><div class="bv-rnr__sc-12ow35w-2 gPRAoB"><div class="bv-rnr__tbt1zd-1 kxrnvR"><div class="bv-rnr__sc-12ow35w-4 efLGLD">Experto HP</div><div class="bv-rnr__sc-16dr7i1-3 bv-rnr__sc-12ow35w-3 fLXmig">Lamentamos los inconvenientes presentados, para nosotros es importante tu experiencia. Con nuestro software HP Omen Gaming Hub podrás personalizar fácilmente el rendimiento y la refrigeración de tu equipo según lo que estés ejecutando, logrando así una temperatura más estable y un funcionamiento óptimo de tu modelo.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></section><div class="bv-rnr__sc-11r39gb-1 dkylWt"><span aria-live="polite" role="alert" class="bv-rnr__sc-1jy9jb6-0 dVKPDM"></span><span aria-live="polite" role="alert" class="bv-rnr__sc-1jy9jb6-0 dVKPDM"></span><div class="bv-rnr__sc-11r39gb-0 dPQiXD"><div class="bv-rnr__sc-11r39gb-2 kxbZtz">1 – 8 de 51   Reseñas</div><ul role="presentation" class="bv-rnr__zv3ryj-1 fHHA-dJ"><li role="presentation"><button disabled="" type="button" role="button" class="prev"><span class="bv-rnr__zv3ryj-0 xgTmN"> AnteriorReseñas </span><div aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 30 30" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><title></title><defs><filter id="pagination_left"><fecolormatrix in="SourceGraphic" values="0 0 0 0 0.239216 0 0 0 0 0.462745 0 0 0 0 0.749020 0 0 0 1.000000 0"></fecolormatrix></filter></defs><g fill="none" fill-rule="evenodd"><path d="M0 0h30v30H0z"></path><g filter="&quot;url(https://www.hp.com/co-es/shop/portatil-hp-gaming-victus-15-fb3008la-amd-ryzen-5-16-gb-ram-nvidia-geforce-rtx-4050-1-tb-ssd-15-6-fhd-144-hz-windows-11-home-ba1u8la.html#pagination_left)&quot;"><path fill="none" d="M29 1v28H1V1z"></path><path stroke="#2c3038" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-l